  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "You may spend a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a> to imbue a weapon or some other portable object with <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/The_Force\" title=\"The Force\">The Force</a>, creating a Talisman that provides protection to you. Creating the Talisman takes a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Full-Round_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Full-Round Action\">Full-Round Action</a>.<br><br>While you wear or carry the Talisman on your person, you gain a +1 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force\">Force</a> bonus to all of your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Defenses\" title=\"Defenses\">Defenses</a> (<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reflex_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reflex Defense\">Reflex Defense</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Fortitude_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fortitude Defense\">Fortitude Defense</a>, and <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Will_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Will Defense\">Will Defense</a>).<br><br>You may only have one <b>Greater Force Talisman</b> active at a given time, and if your <b>Greater Force Talisman</b> is destroyed, you may not create another <b>Greater Force Talisman</b> (or regular <b>Force Talisman</b>) for 24 hours.",
